See docs/provenance.md and docs/licensing.md for scope and origin.

stateatom-execution-probe/{inventory,run}.mjs and
 tests/execution-inventory.test.mjs are original Apache-2.0 acquisition experiments.
They compare captured compiled sources with exact local server receipts and do
not establish execution, object ownership or complete field ancestry.
stateatom-execution-probe/ownership.mjs and tests/ownership-boundary.test.mjs
are original Apache-2.0 negative-control experiments. They retain explicit
Unknown field ancestry while demonstrating equal-value writers.
stateatom-phase2/engine/source-uses.mjs, stateatom-execution-probe/source.mjs
and tests/source-uses.test.mjs are original Apache-2.0 source-only inventory work.
They do not establish runtime aliases, readonly effects or full provenance.
stateatom-phase2/engine/source-functions.mjs and tests/source-functions.test.mjs
are original Apache-2.0 conditional source-fragment verification experiments.
stateatom-execution-probe/entry.mjs is an original Apache-2.0 negative acquisition
experiment. Captured CDP instrumentation pauses are not invocation witnesses.

stateatom-phase2/engine/{query-handoff,query-vendor}.mjs,
stateatom-phase2/tests/{query-handoff,query-vendor}.test.mjs,
stateatom-query-handoff/run.mjs and the synthetic query-controls fixture are
