are not a readonly or alias-lifetime certificate.

stateatom-phase2/engine/write-access.mjs, its write-access tests,
stateatom-write-access/run.mjs and synthetic write-access-controls fixtures are
original Apache-2.0 source-only potential-access instrumentation and controls.
The imported MIT plugin/observer remain MIT. Potential access does not prove
completion, readonly effects, implicit/native/opaque writes or full history.

stateatom-phase2/tests/query-write-vendor.test.mjs,
tests/private-input-boundary.test.mjs, stateatom-query-handoff/writes.mjs and
